/**
 * Panel styles. Scoped by the plugin's own data attributes and .rrp- class
 * prefixes so nothing leaks into the rest of the GUI; colors ride the dsh
 * --dsw-* tokens so the panel follows the active theme. The center-column
 * takeover rules are attribute-scoped and must stay in this stylesheet.
 */
